From 80189e1c6b43c40ffa1d5f27586ce44051a60cfc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:38:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] RISC OS: a stand-in for oneTBB

riscos/tbb: serial parallel loops, real threads for task_group and
task_arena (the AI needs at least 4 workers that can block), mutex-guarded
concurrent containers. On RISC OS, TBB::tbb is an interface target with
this include directory instead of find_package(TBB).
